      "golden_response": "Reference approach (passes all 10 cases):\n\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def lengthOfLongestSubstring(self, s: str) -> int:\n        last = {}\n        best = left = 0\n        for i, ch in enumerate(s):\n            if ch in last and last[ch] >= left:\n                left = last[ch] + 1\n            last[ch] = i\n            best = max(best, i - left + 1)\n        return best\n```",
